<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, calm down! Open this door!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I'm really sorry I kept quiet! But it's dangerous in there!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I sat down in the corner of the room with my ears covered.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">I know that already...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That I'm overthinking and suspecting the two of them, I know that already...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But being told out of nowhere that the culprit of the Megasawa City case is after me, I can't possibly stay calm.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And on top of that, the one who set it in motion is </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I need a little time to calm down.</STYLE><PG>
