{WAIT "500" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内早歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Just then, the sound of many footsteps came thundering up the stairs.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi Kogori-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">! This is Ise of the Motoki Police Station! I've come to protect </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">! Open up!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">That policeman</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s voice.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">This man</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, too, I don't know whether I can trust.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Calm down! Breathe! Not shallow breaths, deep breaths!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Remember what </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> said! </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> told me that because she believed in the strength of my heart!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">How can I betray that!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">but it seems there's no doubt a terrifying murderer is after me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Staying calm at will when I might be killed is next to impossible.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Against my will, cold sweat ran down my forehead.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It seemed to prove how panicked I was, and my mind was thrown into even more disorder.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The more I screamed at myself in my head to calm down, the more my heart </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="おび">cowered</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> at that scream and covered its ears.</STYLE><PG>
