<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">At this sudden switch in my five senses, my head and heart cooled down all at once.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">As if I had turned into a different person, my body moved at once to grasp the situation around me.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">I went to the window and reached for the curtain.</STYLE><PG>
