<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, what are you doing!?</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Hurry, get out through the window!"</STYLE>
