{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<TXSPS>"Aaaah...!"
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>Just bending my elbow a little sent a pain through me like being struck by lightning, and all the strength drained from my body.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I thought I could walk with an arm injury...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This is... impossible...! How am I supposed to get away...!?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">And on top of that, an opponent who dodges bullets.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even if I hadn't been hurt, I can't imagine I'd get away.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\銃声.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "700" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\銃声.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "700" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\銃声.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "700" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s house echoed with gunshots.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Spurred on by the gunshots, I put all my strength into my legs.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Ngh... kh!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">At last the pain in my elbow let me stand, and I began to stagger forward.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, what's going to happen to them?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\ギン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\五島家庭赤.gal" "NORMAL" "15" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\五島家庭.gal" "NORMAL" "15" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Uuugh!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If my arm moved even slightly, the pain was so bad I couldn't stay on my feet.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">My legs just wouldn't carry me forward, and I crouched down.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I didn't know whether it was broken, but walking while enduring this pain was hard.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But if I stay stuck here, will I become the shinigami's prey?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">My head understands, but this is past the limit of what willpower can endure.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\赤い人立ち.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\五島家庭.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">What was that...?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\赤い人立ち.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Come here."</STYLE><PG>
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\五島家庭.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Someone was calling me...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It felt so nostalgic... happy, and sad...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Was it because that voice had distracted me?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The pain eased slightly, and I looked around.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">No one was there.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Could it be my danger sense...?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\赤い人立ち.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Come on, come here."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\五島家庭.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Who...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\追加分\アスファルトゆっくり歩く.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Buffeted by the scattering storm of cherry petals and the strong wind, toward where the voice came from, slowly, slowly.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\ギン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Ngh...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The strong wind moved my elbow slightly, and it hurt.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\ギン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Kuh...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The jolt of each step hurt it even more.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But I didn't stop walking.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The one who's calling me... that person, I'm going to see.</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
